From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 20:01:34 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(sim): verify shallow spot drills with their cone radius

Read the cone footprint at the stock top for ordinary axial drill moves.
Keep the nominal radius for unsupported contexts and cutter shapes.
Pin safe posting and the refusal of a real wall gouge.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #3020
